sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Driver
  participant UI as Cabin display
  participant V as Voice
  participant A as Vehicle agent
  participant G as Allow(q)
  participant M as MHS / SOVD
  participant J as Journal
  participant S as Car speakers
  D->>UI: hold Talk — "What is the battery percentage?"
  UI->>V: audio, only while Talk is held
  V->>A: transcript
  A->>A: fast route picks the readings
  loop each reading
    A->>G: read(capability)
    G->>J: admitted · C0
    G->>M: read
    M-->>A: value + timestamp + source
  end
  A-->>UI: answer + evidence chips
  A-->>V: answer text
  V->>S: spoken answer, through the audio arbiter
